    "body": "The completion rule permits separate issues for the remaining design work.\n\n- #2031 covers Adaptive engagement over proved remaining stock.\n- #2032 covers entry with clearance proved for the full cutter.\n- #2033 covers remaining material from previous operations at each depth.\n\nThese issues define the stock, depth, and entry proofs and their tests. Unknown stock remains occupied. A clear tool axis does not prove a clear cutter rim.\n\nThe current branch adds Zigzag rows and closing boundary passes. Adaptive still has its named refusal. The manual previous-tool mode keeps its existing trust note.\n",
